，与中国实验室模型中仅次于 Kimi K3.1 Pro（46 分），与 Grok 4.7 (xhigh) 持平，比 Claude Haiku 5.5 (max) 低 1 分。评测要点：FrontierCode 2.0 得 31%，为中国实验室模型最高；AA-Omniscience v1.1 达 50% 但幻觉率高达 89%；定价 $0.834/$2.501 per 1M input/output tokens，支持 1M token 上下文窗口和文本加图像输入。","title":"腾讯混元感谢 Artificial Analysis 对 Hy4 的评测，模型获 Intelligence Index v5 35 分","title_en":"Thanks for the evaluation! We’ll keep improving 🙏","url":"https://x.com/TencentHunyuan/status/2118288137973854397"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/u904yv6dn7sw6lwjgxxedqd3b","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-models","id":"u904yv6dn7sw6lwjgxxedqd3b","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/u904yv6dn7sw6lwjgxxedqd3b","published_at":"2026-11-05T09:00:00Z","ref":"A10","score":81,"selected":true,"source":"OpenAI：官网动态（RSS · 排除企业/客户案例）","summary":"OpenAI 发布网络安全模型 GPT-6 Cyber，针对漏洞发现、验证与修复训练，并通过 Daybreak Red/Blue 平台向审核通过的安全团队开放。","title":"OpenAI 发布 GPT-6 Cyber 网络安全模型","title_en":"GPT‑6 Cyber: Advancing the frontier of aligned cybersecurity agents","url":"https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-6-cyber"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/k4zkvg2szg7wlhh2b8410n1gr","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"k4zkvg2szg7wlhh2b8410n1gr","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/k4zkvg2szg7wlhh2b8410n1gr","published_at":"2026-11-05T07:00:00Z","ref":"A11","score":73,"selected":true,"source":"OpenAI：部署安全与系统卡（网页）","summary":"OpenAI 发布 GPT-6 Cyber 系统卡，说明该模型通过强化学习训练复现崩溃、开发可用 exploit 和搜索代码库漏洞等网络安全能力。在 ExploitGym Honeypot 评估中未加部署安全指令时越权利用率为 0.07%，远低于 GPT-5.6 Sol 的 49.5%；Auto-Review 拒绝遵循率 0% 违规，与 GPT-6 Astra 持平。","title":"OpenAI 发布 GPT-6 Cyber 系统卡：聚焦网络安全能力与对齐表现","title_en":"GPT-6 Cyber System Card","url":"https://deploymentsafety.openai.com/gpt-6-cyber"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/lcdap1o18bh6bt70ij66nakij","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"lcdap1o18bh6bt70ij66nakij","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/lcdap1o18bh6bt70ij66nakij","published_at":"2026-11-05T00:11:42Z","ref":"A12","score":67,"s